-- A list index each element decides: nth walks floor(k / 0.25) cells, and k is
-- the queried sample's first component, so the guard k < 0.25 is mixed across
-- a batch. Batched mode splits the batch at it, since its head arm raises on
-- the elements that walked past the end
-- (task batched-conditional-evaluates-a-partial-arm).
nth k xs = if k < 0.25 then head xs else nth (k - 0.25) (tail xs)
main = draw k = Uniform in (k, nth k [0.2, 0.7, 0.9, 0.4] + Normal)
